{"id":"ba3fa296644994fc748b03cd8cb87bb282a6b5c6","axis":"silent","repo":"apache/httpd","sha":"ba3fa296644994fc748b03cd8cb87bb282a6b5c6","parsed":{"files":[{"path":"changes-entries/size-parameter-parse.txt","lines":["@@ -0,0 +1,4 @@","+  *) core: Add ap_size_parameter_parse() and use it to reject malformed","+     ScriptLogLength, ScriptLogBuffer, DavQuota, BufferSize, AuthFormSize,","+     and mod_cache_disk and mod_cache_socache size and time values.","+     [Arturo Bernal]"],"additions":4,"deletions":0,"truncated":false},{"path":"include/ap_mmn.h","lines":["@@ -738,6 +738,7 @@","  * 20211221.30 (2.5.1-dev) Add ap_stat_check() to httpd.h","  * 20211221.31 (2.5.1-dev) Add ap_*_timingsafe() to httpd.h","  * 20211221.32 (2.5.1-dev) Add ap_cstr_stripws() to httpd.h","+ * 20211221.33 (2.5.1-dev) Add ap_size_parameter_parse() to httpd.h","  */"," "," #define MODULE_MAGIC_COOKIE 0x41503235UL /* \"AP25\" */","@@ -745,7 +746,7 @@"," #ifndef MODULE_MAGIC_NUMBER_MAJOR"," #define MODULE_MAGIC_NUMBER_MAJOR 20211221"," #endif","-#define MODULE_MAGIC_NUMBER_MINOR 32             /* 0...n */","+#define MODULE_MAGIC_NUMBER_MINOR 33             /* 0...n */"," "," /**","  * Determine if the server's current MODULE_MAGIC_NUMBER is at least a"],"additions":2,"deletions":1,"truncated":false},{"path":"include/httpd.h","lines":["@@ -2363,6 +2363,18 @@ AP_DECLARE(apr_status_t) ap_timeout_parameter_parse(","                                                apr_interval_time_t *timeout,","                                                const char *default_time_unit);"," ","+/**","+ * Parse a configuration parameter as a base 10 apr_off_t. The whole parameter","+ * has to be a number, there must not be any other character after it. What","+ * values are acceptable is up to the caller.","+ * @param parameter The string containing the number.","+ * @param value The parsed value, only set on success.","+ * @return APR_SUCCESS, APR_EINVAL if the parameter is not a number, or","+ *         APR_ERANGE